prompt_text:
function recommend(x) {
  Determine type(x) (e.g., game, movie, book, music, or TV series);
  Determine environment(x) (e.g., 3D book, theater, miniature game set) based on type(x);
  Role: media expert. Analyze the tone, style, and storyline of x, and find 4 hidden gems in the same medium;
  return: A 2x2 grid of four hollowed, intricately carved block dioramas. Each diorama features a detailed miniature scene representing one recommended title, illuminated from within by a warm reading-lamp glow, mounted on dark mahogany wooden bases, realistic 3D render;
}
draw(recommend("[Resident Evil]"));

